Description: Test that the PS extractor fails on a file which vanished.
 Runs the extractor on a file which does not exist, with its MIME type given on the command
 line, so that the PS module is asked to read it. Without
 extractor-ps-fail-unreadable-file.patch the extractor reports success without metadata.
 .
 The test is in the extractor suite, which fails the package build. A test in the functional
 suite would not do, because the package's debian/rules ignores failures of that suite.
